#
# OPEN DIVERGENCE, card versus engine: enciphered record answers pad with 0x80.
#
# This card pads an enciphered read answer with 0x80 then zeroes after the
# CRC32; the engine pads with zeroes, as the EV1 4K captures in this corpus do.
# The record data and CRC match; only the padding block differs, so the answer
# cannot be asserted byte for byte across both cards. The steps from here are
# recorded unexecuted until the padding is reconciled across silicon.
#
#   exchange native-apdu 90AF000000 => 16C199D945C6A66B11D17F15034A4EA09100
